1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 7]

3
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:54,880
Could it be that in the last life,

4
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,280
he had more information than I did,

5
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,600
so things have changed in this life?

6
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:05,430
Without my order,

7
00:01:05,510 --> 00:01:06,760
no one is allowed to enter.

8
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,590
Anything you cannot decide

9
00:01:08,590 --> 00:01:09,840
must be reported to me immediately.

10
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:11,040
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
[Lu Residence]

12
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,680
I have to get in there.

13
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,480
I can't let this prince

14
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,070
fall into Lu Qingcang's hands.

15
00:01:24,230 --> 00:01:25,710
Stop dreaming, My Lady.

16
00:01:25,790 --> 00:01:27,870
This isn't just anywhere.
This is the Lu residence.

17
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:28,790
Besides,

18
00:01:28,950 --> 00:01:29,760
Lu Qingcang now

19
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,680
has General Wei's full support.

20
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,760
Even the Iron Cavalry has
come to help guard the place.

21
00:01:37,790 --> 00:01:39,310
Why fear the Iron Cavalry?

22
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,040
I have the Golden Armor Guard.

23
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:45,480
[Golden Armor Guard Garrison]

24
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,200
Come on, come on.

25
00:01:52,430 --> 00:01:54,040
Are you real men or not?

26
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:55,400
Five Chiefs!

27
00:01:59,230 --> 00:02:00,430
Brat, drink!

28
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,350
Drink! See, you can drink.

29
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,560
Stop!

30
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:12,840
Come on, come on.

31
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,240
If you can drink, have some more.

32
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:18,280
If you can't finish this cup,
don't leave.

33
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:21,310
That loser Xiao Ningze

34
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,280
and the trash Golden Armor Guard
he leads

35
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:25,680
are no match for Lu Qingcang's men.

36
00:02:26,590 --> 00:02:27,750
Then what do we do now?

37
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:31,630
At this point,

38
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,520
we can only outsmart them.

39
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,750
All right. Again, again.

40
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,190
What's wrong?

41
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,430
General Wei saw how hard

42
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,030
everyone has been working on duty,

43
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,680
so he sent me to bring
food to reward you all.

44
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,080
We've confirmed with
the General's Manor.

45
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:54,800
This man is indeed a cook
from there.

46
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:57,430
All of this was made in
the Manor's kitchen.

47
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:59,120
Even with hundreds of
times my courage,

48
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,710
I wouldn't dare fake it.

49
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:02,360
It's freshly made.

50
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,150
Eat while it's hot.

51
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:04,470
Everyone, eat while it's hot.

52
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,150
Test for poison.

53
00:03:08,150 --> 00:03:08,800
Yes.

54
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:09,910
Wait.

55
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,680
Wait, General Lu,

56
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,960
what do you mean by this?

57
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,400
Are you suspecting the Grand General?

58
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,360
These are special times,
so we need special measures.

59
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:20,190
I'm doing this
for the General's own good.

60
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,120
Bribing a cook
from the General's Manor.

61
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,680
Will this plan work?

62
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,280
We have no soldiers and no advantage.

63
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,280
We can only gamble.

64
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,190
General, the food is clean.

65
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,470
I told you.

66
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:56,800
How could food from
the General's Manor

67
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,240
possibly be poisoned?

68
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,590
Are you now

69
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:03,520
refusing General Wei's reward?

70
00:04:03,910 --> 00:04:05,680
I'll take the food boxes and
share them with the others.

71
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:10,630
You.

72
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,750
Taste everything.

73
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:14,400
Me?

74
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:15,750
Wait, there's so much.

75
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:17,680
I... I can't taste it all.

76
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,040
My Lady,

77
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,870
Lu Qingcang is always suspicious.

78
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:28,870
Can we really fool him?

79
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,270
Nothing has gone wrong yet,

80
00:04:30,430 --> 00:04:32,360
which means things haven't turned bad.

81
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:56,390
I...

82
00:04:59,430 --> 00:05:00,950
Thank General Wei on my behalf.

83
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,190
Hand it out.

84
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,360
Yes.

85
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:07,000
What kind of person is that?

86
00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:26,240
Miss Shen, it worked.

87
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:29,160
Lingxi.

88
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:34,390
Thank you.

89
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,750
Great!

90
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,600
The Manor's food boxes

91
00:05:40,630 --> 00:05:42,120
are made to keep food warm,

92
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,390
so there's a compartment
underneath,

93
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:44,630
filled with hot water.

94
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,600
I replaced the hot water
with a knockout drug.

95
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,600
Whether testing the food
or testing for poison,

96
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,630
Lu Qingcang wouldn't
take the plates out,

97
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:53,870
because not only is it inconvenient,

98
00:05:53,870 --> 00:05:55,240
it would also make the food go cold.

99
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,000
Clever.

100
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:59,240
But when it's time to eat,
it's different.

101
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,720
With so many people
around the food boxes,

102
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,920
it's hard to eat.

103
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,830
So they'll definitely
move the plates aside.

104
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,600
Once the plates are moved,

105
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,040
the trapped poisonous fumes inside

106
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,480
will all come pouring out.

107
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:17,480
Let's go, Lingxi.

108
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:20,360
It's time for me to reap the rewards.

109
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:36,750
Wolfsbane, mugwort.

110
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:37,870
Atractylodes, green vitriol.

111
00:06:38,310 --> 00:06:39,190
General Lu,

112
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:41,000
the meal I prepared for you,

113
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:42,190
do you like it?

114
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,800
Using such dirty tricks every time.

115
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,800
How undignified.

116
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,720
But it still got you tied up here,
didn't it?

117
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,680
Why could you find the
prince in this life?

118
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:56,000
There's still a lot
you don't understand.

119
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,270
Stubborn.

120
00:06:58,510 --> 00:06:59,240
It's useless.

121
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:02,430
He's in my hands now.

122
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,560
Speaking of which.

123
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,000
I should thank you for
helping me find him.

124
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,950
As a prince,

125
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,950
you don't dare show your true face?

126
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,510
Hiding and covering up.

127
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,120
Then let me see

128
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,920
just how ashamed you are to be seen.

129
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,310
Why is it you?

130
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:34,240
Miss Shen, it's been a while.

131
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,040
Where is the prince?

132
00:07:38,070 --> 00:07:39,510
Don't you already know?

133
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:42,160
A person no one could
find in the last life.

134
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:44,270
How would I know where he is?

135
00:07:47,390 --> 00:07:48,680
You tricked me.

136
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,270
You came to me on your own.

137
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,190
What is this really for?

138
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,630
I already told you.

139
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,270
For you.

140
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:00,120
You don't have to believe me.

141
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,040
But I just want you to know,

142
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:04,750
Xiao Ningze is by no means
a good partner.

143
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:06,070
Where's Lingxi?

144
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:09,600
It seems she's already
gone to find Xiao Ningze.

145
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,070
Which means

146
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,680
Shen Shuying not only found

147
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,190
that prince living among commoners,

148
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,480
but also hid him away?

149
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,270
Yes.

150
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,560
Well played, Shen Shuying.

151
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,750
She actually thought of
such a good hiding place.

152
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:25,750
I thank Your Highness on behalf of
my lady for the compliment.

153
00:08:26,950 --> 00:08:27,800
You may leave.

154
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:30,680
You don't need to worry
about what comes next.

155
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,310
Yes, Your Highness.

156
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,320
I'll make a bet with you.

157
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:40,390
Xiao Ningze will immediately

158
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:42,200
go to General Wei

159
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,600
and use his men to
hunt down this prince.

160
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,000
And you

161
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,320
will be a discarded piece.

162
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,080
I believe you must have found

163
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:57,150
a foolproof place to hide us.

164
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:59,480
So no matter who comes
to hunt us down,

165
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,030
it can only be Xiao Ningze
who leaked the secret.

166
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,630
Sowing discord.

167
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,080
He commands the Golden Armor Guard.

168
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,910
Once the new prince is eliminated,

169
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:11,270
why would he ever
be Wei Chengjun's lapdog?

170
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,510
Stop fooling yourself.

171
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:16,720
In the last life,
the Golden Armor Guard had that power

172
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,390
because of you.

173
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:20,120
With just Xiao Ningze,

174
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:22,720
the Golden Armor Guard
is nothing but trash.

175
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,200
In my last life,

176
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,750
I could have married
Xiao Ningze smoothly.

177
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,000
He never betrayed me.

178
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,120
That's only because the real
crisis hadn't appeared yet.

179
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:31,840
The heart of someone like Xiao Ningze

180
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,600
isn't worth testing.

181
00:09:35,630 --> 00:09:36,440
My son,

182
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,960
it's time for you to make your choice.

183
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:42,000
Are you truly determined
to oppose General Wei?

184
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,080
Mother,

185
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,150
I really can't win against that prince

186
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:48,030
or Wei Chengjun?

187
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:51,960
Maybe

188
00:09:52,270 --> 00:09:54,600
this is the fate of those
of us in the inner palace.

189
00:09:57,550 --> 00:10:00,240
If I go surrender to General Wei now,

190
00:10:01,150 --> 00:10:02,670
he'll kill Shen Shuying, won't he?

191
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,270
Sometimes

192
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:10,150
those women are just paving
the way for your great cause.

193
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:12,790
This is the best ending for them.

194
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,630
You know it very well.

195
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,000
Xiao Ningze is a coward.

196
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,510
Let me go, choose me.

197
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:25,960
We can both live.

198
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,510
[General's Manor]

199
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:40,910
You're saying Shen Shuying
kidnapped the new prince

200
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:42,550
and then brought him
back to the Lu residence?

201
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:46,390
No wonder I searched the
whole city with my men

202
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:47,630
and still couldn't find her.

203
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:50,360
Please lend me the Iron Cavalry,
General Wei.

204
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,870
Once I capture Shen Shuying,

205
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,390
she will be at your disposal.

206
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,200
I can also marry Miss Wei again.

207
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,270
After I ascend the throne,

208
00:10:58,630 --> 00:11:00,720
I will share this realm with you.

209
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,630
As long as you kill that prince.

210
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,080
Not so arrogant now, are you?

211
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,480
You're not the only prince now.

212
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,870
I have options.

213
00:11:15,870 --> 00:11:17,840
Please forgive my
youthful recklessness.

214
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:21,030
This prince hasn't been verified yet.

215
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:24,550
Cooperating with me
is the safest choice.

216
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,030
Fine.

217
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,480
Thank you, General Wei.

218
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:39,000
Lu Qingcang really didn't lie to me.

219
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:42,030
He has Xiao Ningze completely tamed.

220
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:52,790
Shen Shuying.

221
00:11:53,870 --> 00:11:55,320
How dare you deceive me!

222
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,150
Search for Shen Shuying!

223
00:11:58,390 --> 00:11:59,080
Yes!

224
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:06,080
Running for our lives with you.
Happy now?

225
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,480
Being doomed lovers isn't bad.

226
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,960
What's good about it?
The clothes are ugly.

227
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,390
You two, stop right there!

228
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:19,840
What do we do?

229
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,630
What else can we do?

230
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,910
Turn around and face me!

231
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,390
Run, of course.

232
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,670
It really is you, Shen Shuying.

233
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,480
Bring me the bow.

234
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:38,510
Are you okay?

235
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,440
I'm fine.

236
00:13:05,250 --> 00:13:09,460
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

237
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:14,230
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

238
00:13:14,660 --> 00:13:18,860
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

239
00:13:19,370 --> 00:13:21,450
♪If fate turns once more♪

240
00:13:21,830 --> 00:13:24,300
♪Will our endings trade places♪

241
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:29,210
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

242
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:33,400
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

243
00:13:33,950 --> 00:13:37,460
♪What tone should I take♪

244
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:40,570
♪To leave no trace♪

245
00:13:40,710 --> 00:13:43,150
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

246
00:13:43,540 --> 00:13:47,870
♪But the moment you come close♪

247
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:52,520
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

248
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:55,380
♪The lamplight flickers♪

249
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:57,820
♪Like your eyes♪

250
00:13:57,890 --> 00:14:01,320
♪Already written into my fate♪

251
00:14:17,070 --> 00:14:21,410
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

252
00:14:21,770 --> 00:14:26,140
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

253
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:30,940
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

254
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:33,600
♪A test used as an excuse♪

255
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:36,440
♪To stir the waters♪

256
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:40,610
♪But the moment you come close♪

257
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:45,490
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

258
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,990
♪The lamplight flickers♪

259
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:50,420
♪Like your eyes♪

260
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:54,880
♪Already written into my fate♪
